* START-HISTORY:
* 28 Oct 26 dm  S.87: multifiles are gone.  PARSER$MFILE (key 5) is retired - a caller asks for PARSER$GET.TOKEN - and a token is never merged with a comma and the next token (the account:file,subfile and file,part forms).
* 27 Oct 26 dm  S.87 batch 12: OPTION BACKSLASH.NOT.QUOTE is gone; a backslash always opens a quoted string, as it did with the option off.
* 12 Sep 26 dm  Name lookups fold as typed, then lower, then upper (plan M1),
*               including the keyword read, which had no as-typed attempt.
